{% raw %}
```liquid liquid
---
eleventyImport:
  collections: ["post"]
---
<ul>
{%- for post in collections.post -%}
  <li>{{ post.data.title }}</li>
{%- endfor -%}
</ul>
```
```jinja2 njk
---
